To create bulk campaign materials for your political party, you can use the following PHP code to generate a list of campaign materials with their respective attributes. This code assumes that you have already created the necessary variables and functions for generating the campaign materials.
```php
<?php
// Define the campaign material types
$campaign_materials = array(
    'poster' => array('width' => 270, 'height' => 420, 'image' => 'poster.jpg'),
    'banner' => array('width' => 150, 'height' => 300, 'image' => 'banner.png'),
    'flyer' => array('width' => 8.5, 'height' => 11, 'image' => 'flyer.pdf')
);

// Generate the campaign materials list
echo "<ul>";
foreach ($campaign_materials as $type => $material) {
    echo "<li>" . $type . ": ";
    if (isset($material['image'])) {
        echo $material['image'];
    } else {
        echo $material['name'];
    }
    echo "</li>";
}
echo "</ul>";
?>
```
This code will output a list of campaign materials with their respective attributes. You can modify the `$campaign_materials` array to include more types of campaign materials or adjust the image file names accordingly.
